# Never let line-ending conversion touch binary files (a PDF's xref offsets
# break if LF becomes CRLF).
*.pdf binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary

# .env files are sourced by shells (`set -a; . ./.env`). With CRLF, bash on
# Linux/macOS/WSL reads every value with a trailing \r (broken password and
# JWT secret), so always check this out with LF, even on Windows.
.env.example text eol=lf
